{#
mail/_insight_strip.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
The insights a conversation carries, as a compact strip above the message
body: icon tile, title, when, and the one action worth a button — tracking the
parcel, opening the thing on GitHub. The mail below states these facts in
prose; the strip states them in a glance, which is the whole trade of an
insight (see MailInsight).

Included from both reading panes — _message_content and _thread_content — with
`only`, so it names its whole contract:

Accepts:
  insights  list<MailInsight>  MailInsightRepository::forThread(), and possibly
            containing DISMISSED rows on purpose: dismissal hides a card from
            the radar panel, not from the mail that plainly states the fact —
            the repository documents that choice.

Renders nothing when the thread carries nothing, which is almost every thread:
the include must stay free for the common case, and an empty "insights" box
over an ordinary mail would claim the extractor looked and found this mail
wanting.

No dismiss button here, deliberately. Dismissal means "stop showing this in
the panel", and this is not the panel — a card that vanished from the mail
that produced it would make the extraction unfalsifiable, the same reasoning
the Happening Soon rows give for their provenance link.
#}

{% set insights = insights|default([]) %}

{% if insights is not empty %}
    <div class="mb-4" data-insight-strip>
        <p class="mb-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-faint">
            {{ 'insights.card.heading'|trans }}
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {% for insight in insights %}
                {% set trackingUrl = insight.payload.trackingUrl|default(null) %}
                {% set externalUrl = insight.payload.url|default(null) %}
                {% set status = insight.payload.status|default(null) %}
                {% set statusTone = {
                    'announced':        'border-ink-faint/40 text-ink-muted',
                    'in_transit':       'border-sky-500/40 text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-300',
                    'out_for_delivery': 'border-amber-500/40 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300',
                    'delivered':        'border-green-500/40 text-green-700 dark:text-green-300',
                }[status] ?? null %}

                <div data-insight-card
                     data-insight-kind="{{ insight.kind.value }}"
                     class="flex min-w-0 max-w-full items-center gap-2.5 rounded-pane border border-line
                            bg-surface py-2 pl-2 pr-3 shadow-sm">

                    {% include 'insight/_kind_chip.html.twig' with { kind: insight.kind, size: 'h-8 w-8' } only %}

                    <div class="min-w-0">
                        <p class="truncate text-sm font-semibold text-ink" title="{{ insight.title }}">
                            {{ insight.title }}
                        </p>
                        <p class="truncate text-xs text-ink-faint">
                            {% if insight.happensAt is not null %}
                                {{ insight.happensAt|intl_date('EEEdMMM') }}
                                {#- A parcel's ETA is a day, not an hour — its midnight
                                    is a placeholder, not a time. -#}
                                {%- if insight.happensAt|date('His') != '000000' %} · {{ insight.happensAt|date(clock.time) }}{% endif %}
                            {% elseif insight.payload.repo|default(null) is not empty %}
                                {{ insight.payload.repo }}{% if insight.payload.number|default(null) is not null %} · #{{ insight.payload.number }}{% endif %}
                            {% else %}
                                {{ insight.kind.transKey|trans }}
                            {% endif %}
                            {% if statusTone is not null %}
                                <span data-insight-status="{{ status }}"
                                      class="ml-1 inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2 py-px
                                             text-[11px] leading-[1.35] font-medium {{ statusTone }}">
                                    {{ ('insights.status.' ~ status)|trans }}
                                </span>
                            {% endif %}
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    {# One primary action per card: the tracking page where there
                       is one, else the thing on GitHub. Never both — a compact
                       card with two buttons is a wide card with none pressed. #}
                    {% if trackingUrl is not empty %}
                        <a href="{{ trackingUrl }}"
                           target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                           data-insight-track
                           class="ml-1 inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent px-2.5 py-1
                                  text-xs font-medium text-accent-ink hover:bg-accent-strong transition-colors">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-location-arrow text-[10px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            {{ 'insights.panel.track'|trans }}
                        </a>
                    {% elseif externalUrl is not empty %}
                        <a href="{{ externalUrl }}"
                           target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                           data-insight-open-url
                           class="ml-1 inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1
                                  text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted hover:bg-hover hover:text-ink transition-colors">
                            <i class="fa-brands fa-github text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            GitHub
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square text-[9px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        </a>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
{% endif %}
